[{:adr/authoritative_for ["genko document model の SSoT は kotoba-lang/kami-genko。\n    kami-engine-sdk の genko-embed.ts は inline 実装を持たず\n    vendor した KamiGenko バンドル (src/lib/genko/vendor/kami-genko.js,\n    来歴コメント付き) に node-tree ops / oplog / serialize を委譲する。\n    挙動差は inline(稼働実績)側を正として kami-genko を直す" "aozora.app/studio の genko canvas は /studio/<slug>/genko、\n    v1 は client-side 完結 (localStorage draft + doc JSON download)。\n    PDS/B2 保存と :gh.manga/* tx 変換は follow-up。\n    etzhayyim XRPC 配線は温存しホスト判定で出し分け" "effectLines / gaze の初のレンダラは kotoba-lang/kami-mangaka-page:\n    draw-effect-lines! (focus/explosion/flash/speed, パネルローカル 0-1000,\n    z-order = tones後・SFX前)、gaze は compose-page! の\n    {:gaze-overlay? true} 指定時のみのレビュー用オーバーレイ (既定 off)" "完全消失系 (Wattpad 自動投稿 / YouTube / Sora 動画 / TTS /\n    3D pose・cinematography / 顔検出+Hume / LoRA / 批評リファインループ /\n    Neo4j+React Flow) は本 ADR スコープ外・現状維持。再実装は個別 ADR" "本セッションでは wrangler deploy しない (aozora.app への反映は\n    オーナーの deploy 判断)"], :adr/supersedes [], :adr/workflow "{:path \"worktree (superproject 外) → session branch push → gh api merges →\\n         gen-west-manifest.cljs --entry 最小 diff で pin 前進\", :deploy \"しない (オーナー判断)\"}", :adr/superseded_by [], :adr/topic "genko-editor-rewire", :adr/related ["90-docs/adr/2607071100-gftdcojp-mangaka-retirement-wave3-aozora-studio.md" "90-docs/adr/2607020200-mangaka-genko-cljc.md" "90-docs/adr/2606282100-mangaka-render-commons-vs-sip-work-split.md" "90-docs/adr/2606282101-mangaka-multilingual-text-layer-cljc-hiccup-reader.md" "90-docs/adr/2607070500-kotoba-lang-manga-viewer-aozora-integration.md"], :adr/status "accepted", :adr/id "adr-2607091300-genko-editor-rewire-effectlines-gaze", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-09", :adr/decision "{:wire [{:what \"genko-embed → KamiGenko 委譲 (vendor bundle + pure refactor)\", :repo [\"com-junkawasaki/kami-engine-sdk\" \"kotoba-lang/kami-genko\"]} {:what \"aozora studio /studio/<slug>/genko canvas (client-side v1)\", :repo [\"gftdcojp/ap